{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981410/extras/fb4eb7d630db0219fef8fa2a67db66a3.avif?t=1756882084\" width=1000 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a research facility, a subject of an unsettling psychological experiment. Guided by the elusive voice of Mr. X, you must push forward through ten uniquely designed rooms\u2014each one built around a different phobia. What begins as a test soon becomes a desperate struggle, as you uncover unsettling truths hidden within the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phobophobia 1.0 \u2013 The Experiment</strong> blends atmospheric storytelling with interactive puzzles and escalating tension. Each room challenges your mind as much as your courage, combining environmental storytelling, eerie sound design, and dynamic lighting to immerse you fully in the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With limited guidance, every choice carries weight. Do you obey the system\u2014or override it? Do you trust Mr. X? Your decisions shape the experience as you progress through this psychological descent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981410/extras/cc49b999444f2e0c74787f7e0c1687d3.avif?t=1756882084\" width=1000 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the experiment\u2019s dark narrative through cryptic terminals and environmental clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981410/extras/d6583dcb07db5063c2d55ba8263e2bf4.avif?t=1756882084\" width=1000 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve challenging puzzles under pressure, surrounded by flickering lights, unsettling soundscapes, and creeping dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981410/extras/9ccedc28267c779b51b12dfed52c8e41.avif?t=1756882084\" width=1000 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fear not only from what you see, but from the anticipation of the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to uncover the truth hidden in the shadows?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3981410?t=1756882084","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981410/5e25c7eed0850b786d34240a91b5afd55d19dbfb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756882084","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981410/12508a4de798c519c022f8edfe086538d48c9e78/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756882084","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981410/12508a4de798c519c022f8edfe086538d48c9e78/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756882084","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981410/extras/fb4eb7d630db0219fef8fa2a67db66a3.avif?t=1756882084\" width=1000 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a research facility, a subject of an unsettling psychological experiment. Guided by the elusive voice of Mr. X, you must push forward through ten uniquely designed rooms\u2014each one built around a different phobia. What begins as a test soon becomes a desperate struggle, as you uncover unsettling truths hidden within the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_par